We're up over 30 thousand feet!

00:00:18.254 --> 00:00:21.354
The Japs don't have any planes
that can go this high.

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:27.834
A bird?

00:00:27.834 --> 00:00:29.974
There are no birds up here.

00:00:29.974 --> 00:00:31.994
Maybe it's a new Jap weapon!

00:00:48.554 --> 00:00:50.124
Esper soldier!

00:00:50.124 --> 00:00:51.694
Can't be! That unit was...

00:00:51.694 --> 00:00:52.924
Shake him off, fast!

00:01:18.284 --> 00:01:21.184
Kanari kiteru Muteki no Power!

00:01:21.584 --> 00:01:24.454
Maji de ii kanji

00:01:24.824 --> 00:01:27.584
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:01:28.024 --> 00:01:31.194
Ashita e saa ikou!

00:01:33.104 --> 00:01:34.234
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:34.234 --> 00:01:35.404
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:01:35.404 --> 00:01:36.674
Zettai Karen Children
Zettai!

00:01:36.674 --> 00:01:38.334
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:38.334 --> 00:01:39.364
Zettai Karen Children
Daitan!

00:01:39.544 --> 00:01:42.844
Fureau dake de wakaru

00:01:42.844 --> 00:01:45.274
Kokoro no limiter

00:01:46.014 --> 00:01:48.704
Tokihanatareta hora

00:01:49.114 --> 00:01:52.314
Yes! Change the world!

00:01:52.554 --> 00:01:55.424
Atsui battle Nandomo try!

00:01:55.724 --> 00:01:59.024
Real wo tsuranuite

00:01:59.024 --> 00:02:02.264
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:02:02.264 --> 00:02:05.194
Thrill ga SAIKOU!

00:02:06.334 --> 00:02:12.804
Yuuki ga sekai no yami wo terashi hajimeru

00:02:12.804 --> 00:02:18.744
Anata ga kureta kiseki afureru

00:02:19.184 --> 00:02:25.574
Darenimo nitenai egao hokori ni shitara

00:02:25.784 --> 00:02:30.324
Mirai wo ima koeyou

00:02:30.324 --> 00:02:34.424
We can try over the future world!

00:02:34.664 --> 00:02:35.024
Yeah!

00:02:35.764 --> 00:02:36.424
Saidai!

00:02:38.564 --> 00:02:39.794
Daitan!

00:02:48.644 --> 00:02:51.214
We've received a request from
the Comerican esper team

00:02:51.214 --> 00:02:52.574
for a joint mission with BABEL.

00:02:52.814 --> 00:02:56.214
Why don't I fill you in on the rest?

00:02:58.414 --> 00:03:03.324
It's useless, little girl. I can use your power, too.

00:03:03.324 --> 00:03:06.354
Until, finally, those three elephants...

00:03:06.424 --> 00:03:09.364
Their strength exhausted, they went to heaven!

00:03:15.504 --> 00:03:16.804
Failure!

00:03:16.804 --> 00:03:20.134
Not only was his power extraordinary,
but he's a master of esper combat!

00:03:21.974 --> 00:03:23.944
Here! No doubt about it!

00:03:23.944 --> 00:03:26.774
All right, we've got him! We need to act at once!

00:03:28.284 --> 00:03:30.844
16th sense.
"A Promise Is Worth Its Weight in Gold!
Memories of A Distant Day..."

00:03:32.354 --> 00:03:34.154
Now, tomorrow morning

00:03:34.154 --> 00:03:36.754
we predict that Colonel Grisham will contact

00:03:36.754 --> 00:03:39.694
the agent planning his
defection at the dam nearby.

00:03:39.694 --> 00:03:42.694
We received an identical report
from the Precog section at HQ.

00:03:42.694 --> 00:03:45.134
They still can't confirm
who he's meeting, though.

00:03:45.364 --> 00:03:47.124
Why... you... stupid!

00:03:47.534 --> 00:03:51.704
The colonel can use the
power of any nearby esper.

00:03:51.704 --> 00:03:54.834
Having a lot of espers close by
will give him an advantage.

00:03:55.344 --> 00:03:56.974
So, either we restrict our numbers...

00:03:56.974 --> 00:03:58.944
Or is it a question of variety?

00:03:58.944 --> 00:04:02.714
I see! Just one type of esper gives him
only one variety of power to use!

00:04:02.714 --> 00:04:05.344
Even so, what type of power is
suitable for capturing him?

00:04:05.884 --> 00:04:08.454
Psychokinesis, wouldn't you say?

00:04:08.454 --> 00:04:09.754
Exactly.

00:04:09.754 --> 00:04:12.554
The ones to directly confront
him should be Mary and Kaoru.

00:04:15.494 --> 00:04:18.464
Hold it! My... My Naomi is a psychokinetic, too!

00:04:18.464 --> 00:04:19.334
Ow!

00:04:19.334 --> 00:04:21.354
Who are you calling "my"?!

00:04:22.134 --> 00:04:24.804
Um, I am a PK too, though...

00:04:24.804 --> 00:04:26.474
Of course we realize that.

00:04:26.474 --> 00:04:29.904
However, your specialty,
the Psychic Stun Subjection...

00:04:31.614 --> 00:04:34.674
is able to render multiple
opponents unconscious.

00:04:37.114 --> 00:04:40.814
If the colonel uses that, he'd
take us all out at once.

00:04:41.254 --> 00:04:43.124
You're right.

00:04:43.124 --> 00:04:47.754
Okay! Good luck on this, Kaoru and Mary!

00:04:49.664 --> 00:04:51.564
It's just me and this little girl?!

00:04:51.564 --> 00:04:54.624
I don't care how big her boobs are,
I don't wanna work with her!

00:04:54.934 --> 00:04:58.704
Don't say that. It's vital for this whole operation.

00:04:58.704 --> 00:05:03.004
If she hadn't butted in this afternoon,
we would've captured the colonel!

00:05:03.174 --> 00:05:05.044
That's a lie!

00:05:05.044 --> 00:05:07.744
If the colonel hadn't used all of your powers,

00:05:07.744 --> 00:05:09.714
we would have caught him!

00:05:09.714 --> 00:05:10.514
What?!

00:05:10.514 --> 00:05:11.584
Both of you, please!

00:05:11.584 --> 00:05:14.914
Do you know this story?

00:05:15.454 --> 00:05:16.624
What's with the guitar?

00:05:16.624 --> 00:05:19.324
Oh, he's doing Comerican traditional!

00:05:19.324 --> 00:05:22.494
Do you know this story?

00:05:22.494 --> 00:05:28.294
Once upon a time, there was
an old man and an old lady...

00:05:29.034 --> 00:05:31.704
Oh, sorry. Wrong lyrics.

00:05:31.704 --> 00:05:33.074
Just tell it normally.

00:05:35.904 --> 00:05:40.644
It was long ago, towards the end of the
war between Japan and Comerica.

00:05:40.644 --> 00:05:45.484
A Comerican bomber crashed in
the mountains near a village.

00:05:45.714 --> 00:05:50.484
The crew were all dead, save one survivor.

00:05:55.994 --> 00:06:00.364
The shock of the crash had
awakened his psychic powers.

00:06:00.864 --> 00:06:05.464
Thanks to that, he was able to
evade his Japanese pursuers.

00:06:05.904 --> 00:06:09.234
But he was also badly wounded.

00:06:12.144 --> 00:06:17.084
He was certain that his life was over.

00:06:19.484 --> 00:06:21.114
Damn!

00:06:23.154 --> 00:06:24.924
Is this it?

00:06:34.804 --> 00:06:36.894
Um... It's water.

00:06:47.744 --> 00:06:53.184
Thanks to that lone Japanese girl,
he escaped from the pit of death.

00:06:57.254 --> 00:06:59.824
She risked her life to nurse him back to health,

00:06:59.824 --> 00:07:03.294
and he was able to safely return to Comerica!

00:07:03.294 --> 00:07:07.134
Oh, what a moving story it is!

00:07:08.434 --> 00:07:12.874
The girl saved the life of an
enemy Comerican soldier!

00:07:12.874 --> 00:07:15.704
Moreover, now Comerica and Japan are allies!

00:07:15.704 --> 00:07:17.974
I think we can get along
better than we have been!

00:07:18.844 --> 00:07:21.084
I absolutely wouldn't save her,
even if she was dying!

00:07:21.084 --> 00:07:22.854
You took the words right out of my mouth!

00:07:22.854 --> 00:07:26.374
Oh! Why won't you understand?!

00:07:29.924 --> 00:07:33.154
Hello, this is Minamoto speaking.

00:07:33.564 --> 00:07:36.354
Hi, it's been a while. Look, I've got a favor to ask.

00:07:36.634 --> 00:07:39.804
Look, Boobulous, being stacked isn't that great!

00:07:39.804 --> 00:07:41.764
When you get old, they're gonna sag SO much!

00:07:41.764 --> 00:07:44.204
Like I'm gonna sweat that from some
girl with a chest like a cutting board.

00:07:44.204 --> 00:07:45.974
What did you call me, Lady Boobzilla?!

00:07:45.974 --> 00:07:48.804
Kaoru! What's your problem with us?

00:07:48.804 --> 00:07:50.474
Is there something about us
that's bothering you?

00:07:50.474 --> 00:07:52.274
The uniforms!

00:07:52.674 --> 00:07:54.514
Your uniforms!

00:07:54.514 --> 00:07:56.254
What's the problem with them?

00:07:56.254 --> 00:07:58.244
Just put them on, please.

00:07:58.714 --> 00:08:00.244
Hurry up!

00:08:05.194 --> 00:08:07.724
Um, these are a little short!

00:08:07.724 --> 00:08:10.464
All right, Naomi! BABEL's Number 1!

00:08:10.464 --> 00:08:12.134
What's wrong with them?

00:08:12.134 --> 00:08:12.734
Dunno.

00:08:12.734 --> 00:08:16.474
NO! You wear miniskirts as
your mission uniforms?!

00:08:16.474 --> 00:08:19.004
They're not suitable for combat at all!

00:08:19.004 --> 00:08:22.444
It's proof you're just mascots
without any combat potential!

00:08:22.844 --> 00:08:25.174
Nothing but panty-flashing girl idols!

00:08:26.744 --> 00:08:28.144
That's not true, Mary.

00:08:28.444 --> 00:08:29.384
Oh?

00:08:29.384 --> 00:08:31.314
That's not true, Mary.

00:08:31.314 --> 00:08:35.184
The one who requested miniskirts
for the uniforms... was HER!

00:08:36.554 --> 00:08:37.494
What?!

00:08:37.494 --> 00:08:38.494
That's news to me!

00:08:38.494 --> 00:08:42.014
Well, getting a little panty flash
from you guys inspires me!

00:08:42.094 --> 00:08:43.334
It brings out my power!

00:08:43.334 --> 00:08:44.794
You hear that, Naomi?

00:08:44.794 --> 00:08:48.004
If your skirt was a little shorter,
it'd inspire me, too!

00:08:48.004 --> 00:08:49.364
I'm shutting up!

00:08:49.364 --> 00:08:51.334
What are you saying?!

00:08:51.334 --> 00:08:54.104
You get looked at, too! You don't mind that?!

00:08:54.104 --> 00:08:56.644
Especially with your big pedo friend around?!

00:08:56.644 --> 00:08:58.704
Don't point at me!

00:08:59.044 --> 00:09:02.144
That's trivial. You don't seem to know

00:09:02.144 --> 00:09:05.454
