Orient, you ignorant Comerican!

00:09:05.454 --> 00:09:06.784
Wh-What?!

00:09:12.054 --> 00:09:13.994
"Give an inch so you can get a mile!"

00:09:16.334 --> 00:09:19.564
Give an inch so you can get a mile...

00:09:19.564 --> 00:09:21.264
Samurai...

00:09:22.604 --> 00:09:26.674
You samurai! I now understand
the heart of a samurai!

00:09:26.674 --> 00:09:28.374
Let's fight together, Cowgirl!

00:09:28.374 --> 00:09:30.074
Yes! We are the world!

00:09:30.744 --> 00:09:33.414
Well, looks like that's been taken care of.

00:09:33.414 --> 00:09:35.044
Do you have a second?

00:09:37.514 --> 00:09:40.384
