00:09:50.634 --> 00:09:54.334
He's a high-level esper, so getting
it directly will be tough,

00:09:54.334 --> 00:09:56.164
but can you get any information from him?

00:09:57.734 --> 00:10:00.264
All right, come to my room in two hours.

00:10:06.614 --> 00:10:07.744
Liberty Bells!

00:10:07.744 --> 00:10:08.774
Feel the beat!

00:10:11.884 --> 00:10:13.784
Kinpira-gobo, gobonuki.

00:10:21.464 --> 00:10:23.264
All personnel are in position.

00:10:23.264 --> 00:10:24.664
Good!

00:10:26.264 --> 00:10:27.604
Okay, go to it.

00:10:27.604 --> 00:10:28.434
Leave it to us!

00:10:28.434 --> 00:10:29.874
Here we go!

00:10:29.874 --> 00:10:32.474
Wildcat and Doubleface, hold at your positions!

00:10:32.474 --> 00:10:33.594
Roger!
Yes, sir!

00:10:35.444 --> 00:10:37.034
Master?

00:10:38.014 --> 00:10:40.184
Um, anything I can do?

00:10:40.184 --> 00:10:42.144
Maybe we called too many
personnel out for this.

00:10:42.144 --> 00:10:44.044
Just... stand by for now.

00:10:45.514 --> 00:10:47.514
Okay team, pull yourselves together
and commence operation!

00:10:50.094 --> 00:10:52.324
Remoteness Clairvoyance!

00:10:52.324 --> 00:10:54.724
Nothing will escape my clairvoyant sight!

00:10:59.364 --> 00:11:02.424
Found him! He's lurking over there!

00:11:02.934 --> 00:11:04.804
Are you ready, Kaoru?

00:11:04.804 --> 00:11:07.204
Yeah! Let's go, Cowgirl!

00:11:07.974 --> 00:11:10.274
Huh? What's wrong, Minamoto?

00:11:10.274 --> 00:11:13.174
Um, nothing. Just be careful, okay?

00:11:14.184 --> 00:11:17.304
Special esper, Kaoru Akashi!

00:11:21.324 --> 00:11:22.374
Released!

00:11:22.524 --> 00:11:23.454
<<RELEASED>>

00:11:24.854 --> 00:11:26.454
Let's go!

00:11:34.404 --> 00:11:37.094
The colonel's using my power!

00:11:38.034 --> 00:11:39.194
We've been noticed!

00:11:40.004 --> 00:11:43.274
Level 7 psychokinetic, Kaoru Akashi!

00:11:43.274 --> 00:11:48.004
And Level 6 hydrokinesis master, Mary Ford!

00:11:49.414 --> 00:11:52.814
I've been waiting for you to come without
anyone else to get in the way!

00:11:52.984 --> 00:11:57.984
Combined with my powers, psychokinetic
abilities are more than doubled!

00:11:58.524 --> 00:12:01.194
What are you talking about, old man?!

00:12:01.194 --> 00:12:05.254
Hmpf! You just have to fight me!

00:12:08.034 --> 00:12:11.094
WATERPROOF BARRIER!

00:12:17.274 --> 00:12:19.214
PSYCHIC...

00:12:19.684 --> 00:12:22.174
SUPER HEEL KICK!

00:12:25.114 --> 00:12:26.584
He's taking us both on at once!

00:12:26.584 --> 00:12:27.954
He's a match for us?!

00:12:29.584 --> 00:12:31.524
Did you forget already?!

00:12:31.524 --> 00:12:34.564
An esper's power can evolve
depending on fighting spirit!

00:12:34.564 --> 00:12:36.494
Now what will you do?!

00:12:39.134 --> 00:12:41.504
Um, you know the story about
the little match girl?

00:12:41.504 --> 00:12:42.704
So pitiful!

00:12:42.704 --> 00:12:44.504
You're the ones who are pitiful.

00:12:44.904 --> 00:12:46.874
Do you know this story?!

00:12:47.874 --> 00:12:48.644
Again?!

00:12:48.644 --> 00:12:51.874
Once upon a time, there was a girl named Mary.

00:12:52.614 --> 00:12:55.444
Mary! The same name as me!

00:12:58.954 --> 00:13:01.354
Poor little Mary.

00:13:01.354 --> 00:13:03.654
She was so sad about how
small her breasts were

00:13:03.654 --> 00:13:06.024
that she asked the medical staff at NASA

00:13:06.024 --> 00:13:08.584
to give her plastic surgery.

00:13:11.164 --> 00:13:14.624
And now she works as an esper
with incredibly huge breasts.

00:13:23.374 --> 00:13:26.004
Seriously?! I'VE BEEN TRICKED!

00:13:26.444 --> 00:13:29.744
That's a dirty lie! And sexual harassment, too!

00:13:31.484 --> 00:13:32.614
DIE!

00:13:32.614 --> 00:13:33.744
KILL YOU!

00:13:35.424 --> 00:13:38.924
Magnificent! You're a couple of fools,
but it still worked!

00:13:38.924 --> 00:13:42.914
I didn't want to know that horrible truth!

00:13:43.994 --> 00:13:45.894
They are REALLY worked up!

00:13:45.894 --> 00:13:46.504
Now!

00:13:46.504 --> 00:13:47.124
Right!

00:13:47.834 --> 00:13:50.034
What?! What's the deal?

00:13:50.034 --> 00:13:52.404
I thought Naomi was sitting this operation out.

00:13:53.004 --> 00:13:54.374
I'm joining in!

00:13:54.374 --> 00:13:56.174
Huh? But...

00:13:56.174 --> 00:13:57.914
It's okay, Kaoru!

00:13:57.914 --> 00:14:00.784
All of you, work together to
raise the water over the dam!

00:14:00.784 --> 00:14:01.784
The water?

00:14:01.784 --> 00:14:05.084
Yeah. That was the colonel's real objective.

00:14:09.854 --> 00:14:10.944
How did you?

00:14:11.654 --> 00:14:13.354
Sorry we took so long!

00:14:15.194 --> 00:14:16.754
Saya!

00:14:17.464 --> 00:14:18.534
How is she?

00:14:18.534 --> 00:14:20.764
It's okay, she's stable.

00:14:22.064 --> 00:14:26.124
60 years ago, Colonel Grisham
was saved by this woman.

00:14:26.874 --> 00:14:29.874
Two weeks ago, when the colonel
was stationed here in Japan,

00:14:29.874 --> 00:14:34.474
he visited her and learned that she
didn't have much longer to live.

00:14:38.454 --> 00:14:40.214
Her last wish was to see her home,

00:14:40.284 --> 00:14:43.584
now flooded under the reservoir, one last time.

00:14:45.694 --> 00:14:49.624
He needed powerful espers to
make that wish come true.

00:14:49.894 --> 00:14:52.534
And so he figured out a way

00:14:52.534 --> 00:14:56.164
to use Mary's hydrokinesis and
Kaoru's psychokinesis!

00:14:57.834 --> 00:14:59.394
You can see the bottom now!

00:14:59.804 --> 00:15:04.404
But he needed a major incident
to get both of you out here.

00:15:04.544 --> 00:15:07.414
And then he got the idea of
engineering his own defection

00:15:07.414 --> 00:15:10.174
to get the Japanese and Comerican
governments involved.

00:15:10.784 --> 00:15:13.054
Then he used Ken, his former subordinate,

00:15:13.054 --> 00:15:16.524
to confirm Kaoru's power
yesterday at Aramagawa

00:15:16.524 --> 00:15:19.614
to get ready for the real show today!
Right, Ken?!

00:15:19.694 --> 00:15:22.924
Oh, my secret's out! What'll I do?!

00:15:48.184 --> 00:15:49.214
Thank you.

00:16:00.604 --> 00:16:04.904
This is a terribly personal matter.
I have no reason to ask for your help.

00:16:04.904 --> 00:16:06.204
But, Colonel!

00:16:06.204 --> 00:16:08.874
Everything we choose to do is a personal matter!

00:16:08.874 --> 00:16:10.674
It wouldn't be any trouble for us...

00:16:10.674 --> 00:16:12.264
It's too late.

00:16:13.484 --> 00:16:16.014
Wh-What do you mean, Colonel?

00:16:16.014 --> 00:16:19.614
There's another reason why I didn't
come clean to you yesterday.

00:16:19.614 --> 00:16:22.644
That came with my personal
experience with you.

00:16:24.424 --> 00:16:26.894
P-Personal experience?

00:16:26.894 --> 00:16:29.054
Look at the ones next to you.

00:16:31.934 --> 00:16:33.904
Wh-Why?

00:16:33.904 --> 00:16:36.604
Why weren't you honest with us?

00:16:36.604 --> 00:16:38.264
Because...

00:16:39.304 --> 00:16:43.004
Telling you the truth would have
weakened your powers.

00:16:48.244 --> 00:16:51.184
Let's go, Cowgirl! Time we did this for real!

00:16:51.184 --> 00:16:53.154
Okay, Samurai Girl!

00:16:53.384 --> 00:16:57.024
PSYCHIC WHIRLPOOL TIDE!

00:16:57.024 --> 00:16:59.284
WATER TORNADO!

00:17:08.704 --> 00:17:11.004
Saya, please look!

00:17:23.184 --> 00:17:24.854
Go! You've almost got it!

00:17:24.854 --> 00:17:25.874
Keep it up!

00:17:29.384 --> 00:17:31.354
This old body has to hold out!

00:17:31.354 --> 00:17:32.354
We got more to give!

00:17:32.354 --> 00:17:34.324
Last spurt, Colonel!

00:17:34.624 --> 00:17:35.424
Japan...

00:17:35.424 --> 00:17:37.034
and Comerica...

00:17:37.034 --> 00:17:38.964
FRIENDSHIP POWER!

00:17:57.384 --> 00:18:00.944
No doubt about it! That's the house
she was born and raised in!

00:18:09.694 --> 00:18:12.064
Wh-What's going on?

00:18:18.174 --> 00:18:20.574
What... What on Earth?!

00:18:22.574 --> 00:18:25.244
Is this an illusion caused by
the colonel's telepathy?

00:18:25.244 --> 00:18:27.834
Or else it's hypno power!

00:18:28.644 --> 00:18:30.114
Is it him?!

00:18:34.424 --> 00:18:38.084
Such memories it holds...
Thank you, Mr. Grisham.

00:18:39.654 --> 00:18:42.284
Any thanks should go to
everyone who helped me.

00:18:49.204 --> 00:18:50.774
I'm really grateful.

00:18:50.774 --> 00:18:51.734
Saya...

00:19:11.024 --> 00:19:14.564
Thank you so much for yesterday. I'm grateful.

00:19:14.564 --> 00:19:17.264
Colonel, please. That isn't necessary.

00:19:17.264 --> 00:19:19.924
Especially for erasing the
evidence of my desertion.

00:19:22.234 --> 00:19:25.674
A false report was filed that my disappearance

00:19:25.674 --> 00:19:29.074
was due to a kidnapping by an anti-esper group.

00:19:29.404 --> 00:19:32.014
Wasn't that BABEL's doing?

00:19:32.014 --> 00:19:33.374
I don't know anything about that!

00:19:33.374 --> 00:19:37.454
There's no way the chief or I wouldn't
have heard about an action like that.

00:19:37.454 --> 00:19:41.454
That would require incredibly high-level
psychic powers to pull off.

00:19:41.454 --> 00:19:43.944
Was it him, doing it for Kaoru's sake?

00:19:45.754 --> 00:19:49.424
No, I didn't do it because I
wanted the Queen's thanks.

00:19:49.894 --> 00:19:54.134
And of course, not because I
wanted the colonel to join us.

00:19:54.134 --> 00:19:56.264
Then why did you do it?

00:19:56.264 --> 00:19:57.864
The old man was an acquaintance of mine.

00:20:06.944 --> 00:20:12.744
It may have been the wounds I inflicted
that awakened his psychic powers.

00:20:15.454 --> 00:20:19.394
Well, maybe I was just feeling a little nostalgic.

00:20:25.934 --> 00:20:30.634
Go on, look at me!

00:20:30.634 --> 00:20:34.874
Truly, the bond of love we share

00:20:34.874 --> 00:20:37.274
is absolute!

00:20:37.274 --> 00:20:42.014
An eternal, unchanging

00:20:42.014 --> 00:20:48.924
absolute declaration to the world
I'll shout from Everest!

00:20:49.124 --> 00:20:51.994
L-O-V-E! Love, love Children!

00:20:51.994 --> 00:20:53.424
L-O-V-E!

00:20:53.424 --> 00:20:56.894
Minamoto! Let's sing a duet next!

00:20:56.894 --> 00:20:59.664
Hey! Minamoto's singing with me next!

00:20:59.664 --> 00:21:03.964
No, no! We're going to sing, with Minamoto's
elbow pressed into my boobs!

00:21:07.004 --> 00:21:08.844
Isn't this part of entertaining a business partner?

00:21:08.844 --> 00:21:10.544
You don't sell women as part of it!

00:21:10.544 --> 00:21:12.944
What about this song, Mr. Minamoto?

00:21:12.944 --> 00:21:13.944
I'll take this one.

00:21:13.944 --> 00:21:15.944
Don't cut in on us!

00:21:15.944 --> 00:21:19.184
Keep this up and I'll declare use of
force to ensure free competition!

00:21:19.184 --> 00:21:21.514
Just try it, Boobulous! I'm ready for you!

00:21:21.954 --> 00:21:25.224
I should teach you how scary a
teleporter can be, sometime.

00:21:25.224 --> 00:21:26.824
Cut it out.

00:21:26.824 --> 00:21:27.824
W-Wait!

00:21:27.824 --> 00:21:31.164
That stuff about white guys getting
the girls in Japan is a damn lie!

00:21:31.164 --> 00:21:33.434
I'll buy you whatever you want!
Nobody's hitting on me!

00:21:33.434 --> 00:21:35.594
Enough, already!

00:21:38.334 --> 00:21:41.104
To you, who shoulder the burden of the future!

00:21:41.104 --> 00:21:44.144
Swear yourselves to a friendship that
crosses borders and generations!

00:21:44.144 --> 00:21:46.914
Never hesitate to support that, Minamoto!

00:21:46.914 --> 00:21:49.174
You know this song, don't you?

00:21:49.914 --> 00:21:51.854
Oh God, not that song!

00:21:52.384 --> 00:21:55.214
Grow up to be strong and gentle espers!

00:21:55.754 --> 00:21:58.284
I sing you this song, to send
those feelings to you!

00:21:59.724 --> 00:22:04.064
Deep beneath the waters of that mighty dam,

00:22:04.064 --> 00:22:09.394
was the home of the woman that I loved...

00:22:10.734 --> 00:22:16.174
DATTE Daihon'mei

00:22:16.174 --> 00:22:16.474
Yeah

00:22:33.524 --> 00:22:36.794
Anata no mae jaa, hora

00:22:38.534 --> 00:22:44.064
ESP mo yaku ni tatanai no

00:22:44.404 --> 00:22:50.534
Pitagorasu de sae mo kaimei dekinai

00:22:50.914 --> 00:22:53.174
Koi wa chie no wa

00:22:55.414 --> 00:23:00.114
Naki sou na kao shite utsumuicha dame da yo

00:23:00.554 --> 00:23:05.424
Egao kara kiseki wa umareru da mon

00:23:06.094 --> 00:23:07.524
DA DA Daihon'mei

00:23:07.524 --> 00:23:07.824
Kyun kyun!

00:23:07.824 --> 00:23:08.824
Anata wo

00:23:08.824 --> 00:23:09.264
Bye-bye!

00:23:09.264 --> 00:23:12.994
Daitan futeki mono shitai

00:23:13.134 --> 00:23:17.134
Kanari tsubireru hodo maji na no zettai!

00:23:17.134 --> 00:23:18.574
DA DA Daihenshin

00:23:18.574 --> 00:23:18.874
Kyun kyun!

00:23:18.874 --> 00:23:19.834
Anata e

00:23:19.834 --> 00:23:20.474
Hai hai!

00:23:20.474 --> 00:23:25.304
Dainamaito na kuchidzuke wo ageru

00:23:25.444 --> 00:23:28.214
Suki na'tte hoshii no zettai!

00:23:28.214 --> 00:23:38.414
DATTE Daihon'mei

00:23:39.954 --> 00:23:41.124
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:41.124 --> 00:23:42.964
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.964 --> 00:23:43.224
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.224 --> 00:23:46.864
Your task is, under my direction, to steal the
stuffed animals carried by The Children.

00:23:46.864 --> 00:23:48.204
Understood, Mr. Minamoto!

00:23:48.204 --> 00:23:49.534
Hatsune will do her best!

00:23:49.534 --> 00:23:51.404
They won't be holding back, you three!

00:23:51.404 --> 00:23:52.834
That's our line!

00:23:52.834 --> 00:23:56.144
No way we'll lose to newbs like them.

00:23:56.144 --> 00:23:57.674
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:57.674 --> 00:24:00.944
Episode 17: "Survival of the Fittest!
We're Gonna Eat You!"

00:24:00.944 --> 00:24:04.014
Getting Mr. Minamoto as our
instructor! I'm so grateful!

00:24:04.014 --> 00:24:04.984
Akira, isn't it time to eat yet?

00:24:04.984 --> 00:24:06.314
Survival of the Fittest!
We're Gonna Eat You!
Akira, isn't it time to eat yet?

00:24:06.314 --> 00:24:08.624
Survival of the Fittest!
We're Gonna Eat You!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.624 --> 00:24:09.954
Survival of the Fittest!
We're Gonna Eat You!
